{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203260","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1320326001:1":{"text":"Thank you all for helping me gather these materials. Now, I can begin restoring the painting.","source_cn":"多谢你们陪我找到这些材料。之后我要开始修复画作了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA2D669C0CC34751","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320326002:1":{"text":"As for this charm...","source_cn":"至于这个护符……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD10BEDC6FDB29BE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::2":{"text":"Ludovic's Amulet","source_cn":"柳博米尔的护符","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7CD923C36D6B78D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320326003:2":{"text":"...Hold on! Ludovic, why did you break it?!","source_cn":"……等等！柳博米尔，你为什么要打碎它？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63713B02B1DD390B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320326004:1":{"text":"Because it's made of lapis lazuli.","source_cn":"因为它——青金石。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF54F16DADF9402E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320326005:1":{"text":"To keep the paint colors vibrant, I'll need lapis lazuli powder mixed with the dust we just collected.","source_cn":"想要修复这幅画，必须在颜料中加入青金石粉末，这样才能在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x533E31ADDCFF0D5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320326006:1":{"text":"But... isn't lapis lazuli super rare and valuable? Plus, this charm held your hopes from your past life.","source_cn":"可是……青金石这么稀有的宝石很贵重，而且这个护符又承载...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1515E14FE4A1926","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320326007:1":{"text":"It feels like a pity to break it...","source_cn":"就这样毁掉，是不是太可惜了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBF0C460BD26AA1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1320326007":{"text":"It feels like a pity to break it...","source_cn":"就这样毁掉，是不是太可惜了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBF0C460BD26AA1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320326010:1":{"text":"The person who buried the charm is long gone, and that chapter of life is completely closed. This charm... along with its intangible hopes, has lost all significance.","source_cn":"埋下护符的人已经死了，那段生命中的一切都已经彻底结束。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BD39F09DC94C16D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320326011:1":{"text":"Please leave the restoration to me. I kindly ask you to make another trip to Cedartown to <style=\"highlight\">inform Levski</style> that I'm in the process of restoring his painting.","source_cn":"修复工作交给我就好。劳烦你们再去一趟雪松镇，将这个消息...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5D0D156A91ADCC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320326012:1":{"text":"Tell him to be patient a little longer. Once it's restored, I will return it to him.","source_cn":"请他再耐心等待一阵。等这幅画恢复原样，我会还给他的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F50B332DE98E16F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"He can decide what to do with it.","source_cn":"他有权利决定如何处置自己的东西","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF6CF0DA42AFEAA60","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"He can decide what to do with it.","female":"He can decide what to do with it.","variant_male_record_index":"68930","variant_female_record_index":"68931","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320326008:1":{"text":"Wealth is meaningless for a Graveborn.","source_cn":"对于亡灵来说，钱财不值一提。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x359F31227D59C1AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"It's worth quite a fortune...","source_cn":"那可是一大笔钱……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEECC82E1C8BCB0F9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's worth quite a fortune...","female":"It's worth quite a fortune...","variant_male_record_index":"68932","variant_female_record_index":"68933","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320326009:1":{"text":"I want to make this painting look like it used to as quickly as possible.","source_cn":"嗯。我只想尽快开始修复画作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39346C33E42BA52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:2:3":{"text":"It saves us the hassle of finding it!","source_cn":"总好过让我们去找青金石！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x190F3C111C49B8EA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It saves us the hassle of finding it!","female":"It saves us the hassle of finding it!","variant_male_record_index":"68934","variant_female_record_index":"68935","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"Ludovic","source":"柳博米尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}}